sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web UI (Next.js)
  participant P as Vercel /api proxy
  participant A as API (FastAPI)
  participant S as SQLite store
  participant G as Calendar provider (mock / Google)

  U->>W: choose PDF, school, year, timezone
  W->>P: POST /api/uploads/extract
  P->>A: same request + X-API-Key
  A->>A: validate (magic bytes, size, pages, encryption)
  A->>A: PyMuPDF words + vector fills
  A->>A: grid -> dates, legend parse, colour match (Delta E), classify
  A-->>W: events + legend + warnings + per-event evidence
  W->>A: POST /api/imports (record import)
  A->>S: save import, diff vs previous import of same school/year
  A-->>W: already_imported? / added / removed / changed
  U->>W: review, edit, confirm ambiguous events, confirm legend
  U->>W: Download ICS / CSV (server re-checks readiness)
  U->>W: Preview sync
  W->>A: POST /api/sync/preview
  A->>G: list events in date range (all pages)
  A->>S: load manifest
  A-->>W: plan (create/update/skip/conflict/propose_remove) + plan_token
  U->>W: tick confirmation, Confirm and sync
  W->>A: POST /api/sync/execute (confirm=true, plan_token)
  A->>A: recompute plan - token must match, else 409
  loop each create/update
    A->>G: find by owner id, then create/update (bounded retries)
    A->>S: upsert mapping (stable id -> provider id, batch)
  end
  A-->>W: report (created/updated/adopted/skipped/failed)
